sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / llm-d-deployer
    participant API as kube-apiserver<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Ctrl as modelservice-controller-manager<br/>SA token
    participant Prom as Prometheus
    participant Client as Inference Client
    participant GW as Gateway<br/>parentRef of HTTPRoute
    participant EPP as EPP Service<br/>9002/TCP gRPC ext-proc
    participant Decode as Decode Pod<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Prefill as Prefill Pod<br/>8000/TCP HTTP

    Note over User,Ctrl: Flow 1: ModelService reconciliation
    User->>API: Create ModelService<br/>User credentials + RBAC (editor role)
    API-->>Ctrl: Watch event (HTTPS watch, SA token)
    Ctrl->>API: GET BaseConfig ConfigMap<br/>(may be another namespace)
    API-->>Ctrl: BaseConfig YAML
    Note over Ctrl: In-process: template interpolation (Sprig) + mergo merge
    Ctrl->>API: CreateOrUpdate ConfigMaps, PD/EPP Deployments,<br/>Services, SAs, EPP RoleBinding,<br/>HTTPRoute, InferencePool, InferenceModel
    Ctrl->>API: GET Deployments
    Ctrl->>API: PATCH ModelService status

    Note over Client,Prefill: Flow 2: Inference runtime (controller not in data path)
    Client->>GW: Request (HTTP/HTTPS, auth per Gateway)
    GW->>EPP: ext-proc gRPC 9002/TCP<br/>No TLS, no auth (samples)
    EPP-->>GW: Selected endpoint
    GW->>Decode: HTTP 8000/TCP<br/>No TLS, no auth (samples)
    Decode->>Prefill: Routing sidecar HTTP 8000/TCP<br/>+ NIXL KV transfer 5557 (samples)
    Prefill-->>Decode: KV cache / prefill result
    Decode-->>GW: Response
    GW-->>Client: Response

    Note over Prom,Ctrl: Flow 3: Metrics scrape
    Prom->>Ctrl: GET /metrics 8443/TCP HTTPS<br/>Bearer token (self-signed TLS default)
    Ctrl->>API: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview
    API-->>Ctrl: Allowed / denied
    Ctrl-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
